displayName: "CryoDrills"
name: "CryoDrills"

author: "moderntymb"

main: "example.ExampleJavaMod"

description: "Adds cryofluid cooling support to vanilla drills. Cryofluid is consumed faster than water but provides a stronger drilling boost. Water and cryofluid cannot be mixed."

